Subject: [PATCH v4 2/3] drm/panel: support Innolux P097PFG panel
Date: Wed, 14 Mar 2018 17:12:15 +0800
Message-Id: <1521018736-20980-2-git-send-email-hl@rock-chips.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.7.4
